OL,3,AMinister says 32 UK government services
OL,4,Aunavailable due to global
OL,5,Acyber-security issue
OL,6,
OL,7,FA UK minister says 32 government
OL,8,Fservices are unavailable due to a
OL,9,Fglobal cyber-security issue, with four
OL,10,Fpartially unavailable
OL,12,FDowning Street says "no large
OL,13,Fpublic-facing critical services are
OL,14,Fbeing affected", but some "limited
OL,15,Fservices may temporarily be offline"
OL,16,Fwhile work is carried out. "This does
OL,17,Fnot mean they were hacked," it adds
OL,19,FAround the world, organisations are
OL,20,Fscrambling to fix the security flaw
OL,21,Fthat could affect millions of websites
